# The first worker claims (2,2) before the second worker draws its random step.
# A claimed destination is already occupied for the picker even while the
# claimant's body is still gliding in.  Excluding it sends the second worker
# east into its hole; choosing it leaves that worker stranded on (2,2).
name Random Step Claimed Destination
dim 5 5
ent wall 0 2
ent hole 3 2
ent hole 3 3
ent worker 1 2
ent worker 2 3
goal all_exited
